{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outwit. Outshoot. Or die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Quill &gt; Pistol</i> is a turn-based dueling game where mathematics is your weapon\u2014and the only thing standing between you and death. Play as <strong>The Mathematician</strong>, a scholar dragged from the comforts of academia into a ruthless underground tournament, where logic is tested against lead, and every miscalculation could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each duel is a puzzle. Each opponent, a nightmare. Face deadly foes, from twisted inventors to occult duelists, as you unravel the dark secrets behind the blood-soaked tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will your intellect save you? Or will you become another name etched into the ledger of the dead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd22 Solve unique math-themed mini-games to prepare your shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf Earn skill cards to tip the odds in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad Face a gallery of bizarre, deadly opponents, each with unique tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6 Uncover a dark, stylish narrative blending wit and dread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Engage in tense, turn-based duels where every calculation counts</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717190?t=1747056774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717190/e6e317432de32605a78f3f6ca21d7ea0b8f4b3e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747056774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717190/85ae2e2011c810fe7231e66e66a18d9948d56756/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747056774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717190/85ae2e2011c810fe7231e66e66